    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just being an outsider though. it's like... there's this fundamental incompatibility. like some people are built for this world and i'm just a glitch in the system. no matter how hard i try to adapt, it just feels like i'm wasting my energy on something that's never going to work. i'm just so done with the effort.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
